      <activity id="c4d8d9ac-07d5-5376-96da-f98bf13aa692" activityNameId="05f4d80e-3719-58d8-9f38-288fca085473" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Hard coal supply mix</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Hard coal supply mix
Update 2022 by ZHAW only updated domestic production shares and shares of imports, Remark: Average transport distance for coal from Chinese statistics 2004. Average coal losses assumed 3%. Other values are from similar datasets for European countries. Dust from transport and load/unload operations is included. Average emissions to water due to leaching from coal heaps at storage at receiving terminal is estimated from the literature.; NA; UUID: 9c5a1939-fd35-35fc-a925-c9b14658448a
Included processes: Country-specific supply of coal, assumed all domestic for CN. The module includes transport from mines to power plants
Location: Geography: Transport distance is from CN Statistics. Losses are best guess for CN based on literature.
Technology: Technology: Not specified
Time period: 
Production volume: 
Sampling: Sampling procedure: literature
Extrapolations: Extrapolations: see Geography/Text
Uncertainty adjustments: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_9c5a1939-fd35-35fc-a925-c9b14658448a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
